<newsitem itemid="111920" id="root" date="1996-10-11" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Muenchener Hypo adds 200 mln marks to five-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Muenchener Hypo adds 200 mln marks to five-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced by lead manager Commerzbank on Wednesday has been increased.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MUENCHENER HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *300 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0 PCT   MATURITY    30.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR YEAR ONE, RISING TO 4.5 PERCENT IN YEAR TWO,</p>
<p>		5.0 PERCENT IN YEAR THREE, 6.0 PERCENT IN YEAR FOUR</p>
<p>		AND 6.5 PERCENT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		CALLABLE ON 30.OCT.97</p>
<p>	     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MLN MARKS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
